# block-string-comment-literal-body

## Input

```
key |
  line 1
  # not a comment
  line 2 # also not a comment

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..63
  ENTRY@0..63
    WORD_KEY@0..3
      WORD@0..3 "key"
    SPACE@3..4 " "
    BLOCK_STRING@4..63
      BLOCK_STRING_HEADER@4..6
        PIPE@4..5 "|"
        NEWLINE@5..6 "\n"
      SPACE@6..8 "  "
      LINE_STRING@8..14
        STRING@8..14 "line 1"
      NEWLINE@14..15 "\n"
      SPACE@15..17 "  "
      LINE_STRING@17..32
        STRING@17..32 "# not a comment"
      NEWLINE@32..33 "\n"
      SPACE@33..35 "  "
      LINE_STRING@35..62
        STRING@35..62 "line 2 # also not a c ..."
      NEWLINE@62..63 "\n"
```

## AST

